WEBVTT

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.290
That's...

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.170
God has resurrected.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:34.770
What's the meaning of this?

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.270
Even if the player dies, god doesn't!

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.900
When a god on the field is destroyed and sent to the 
graveyard, it's Special Summoned during the End Phase!

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:44.990
What?

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:52.430
If Red Nova Dragon symbolizes your bond, 
then the three Aesir symbolize our bond!

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:58.660
When this effect Special Summons Thor, Lord 
of the Aesir, you take 800 points of damage!

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:05.690
Jack!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.850
We're counting on you, Brave!

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:24.060
Yeah!  Thanks for leaving me the god!

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:28.310
Dragan, do you feel better now?

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:33.770
Yeah.  Because even though I 
lost, I gave everything I had.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:36.980
You don't look it.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:40.710
Team 5D's is strong.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.870
But we have the god cards.

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:48.540
When facing a god, even they will cringe.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:54.380
Brave, Team Ragnarok's second wheeler, 
plays expertly by using transformations!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.040
That's why he's known as the trickster!

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:03.330
What strategy will he use?  C'mon!

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.880
I'm your next opponent, Jack Atlas!

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:11.990
Duel!

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.810
My turn!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.900
I set two cards.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:20.650
I'll use my god's effect.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.620
Red Nova Dragon's effect is negated!

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.160
Their attack points are now equal.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.730
But I'll show you the 
god's overwhelming power!

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.810
Jack, you'll perish together!

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:44.670
Red Nova Dragon and Thor, Lord 
of the Aesir destroy each other!

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.290
Thunder Pyle!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.650
I end my turn!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:12.460
Even if Thor, Lord of the Aesir is 
destroyed and sent to the graveyard,

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.720
it resurrects at the End Phase, 
and you take 800 points of damage!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.390
Whoa!

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:27.010
Jack Atlas is eliminated!

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.270
Riding Duels.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:33.370
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:40.310
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:04:01.520
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:11.630
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:17.870
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:23.810
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:29.580
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:35.190
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:41.560
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:47.370
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:53.670
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:59.980
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:29.810
Descend!  The Second God  
Loki, Lord of the Aesir

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.280
See ya!

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.370
I defeated Jack Atlas first!  I won!

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.660
He wanted them to destroy each other.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:46.650
Even if it's destroyed, it resurrects 
during the End Phase and deals damage.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.460
What an incredible card.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.650
Jack, are you okay?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:55.570
Crow, those impacts were real.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.490
Be careful.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.960
Crow!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.540
Crow, do your best!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.950
Crow!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.630
Leave it to me!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:11.110
I promise to defeat him for you!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.380
The god cards...

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:24.010
The other two also have those cards.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.100
Crow knows that too.

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.070
He can't allow them to summon another god.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:36.070
Team 5D's second wheeler is Crow the Bullet!

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.410
Crow Hogan is here!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:42.410
Crow, I'll defeat you quickly!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.120
Don't underestimate me!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:44.960
Here I go!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.430
Duel!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.190
My turn!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:55.660
Due to his trap Solemn Authority, 
I can't use traps against his god.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:59.350
In that case, I'll show you 
the power of my Blackwings!

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:03.080
I summon Blackwing - Sirocco the Dawn!

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:09.050
I can summon Sirocco the Dawn without tributing 
when monsters are only on your side of the field!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:13.830
When a Blackwing is on my 
field, I can Special Summon

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.160
the Tuner Monster Blackwing 
- Gale the Whirlwind!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.320
Gale the Whirlwind's effect activates!

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:27.100
Once per turn, your monster's attack 
and defense points are halved!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.670
When the total Level of 
my Blackwings equals 8,

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:38.340
I can Special Summon Blackwing 
- Calima the Haze!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:44.170
Level 3 Gale the Whirlwind 
tunes Level 4 Calima the Haze!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.650
Black wind, turn into wings 
that rise to the heavens!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.100
Synchro Summon!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:53.300
Blackwing Armor Master!

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:56.820
Armor Master attacks Thor, Lord of the Aesir!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.830
Black Hurricane!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.860
I'm not done!  Blackwing - Sirocco 
the Dawn attacks you directly!

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:10.770
Darkwing Slash!

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.850
The Bullet already landed a big shot!

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:21.800
He defeated the god and took away 
a lot of Brave's life points!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.280
All right!

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:31.730
Your god may be invincible, but its human 
controller has a limited amount of life points!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.480
My life...

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.730
My life!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:36.920
Just kidding.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.640
I flip over my trap card The Golden Apples!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:46.100
When I have no monsters, I regain all 
battle damage that I took this turn!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.320
What?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.750
Oh no!  Crow's first attack was pointless!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.490
Everything is back to the start!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.650
Then I Special Summon a 
Malus Token whose attack

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:03.450
and defense points are 
equal to the damage I took!

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:08.910
Not only did he regain his life points, but 
he now has a monster with 2750 attack points!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.070
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:16.630
Thor resurrects from the 
afterlife at the End Phase!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:25.780
Due to Thor's effect, you 
take 800 points of damage!

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:33.730
This is the power of a god.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:37.080
Crow, you don't understand anything.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:42.940
The more high-Level monsters you 
summon, the more you hurt yourself!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.150
My turn!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:09.320
The trap card Solemn Authority's effect ends 
at the second Standby Phase after activation!

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:13.370
He can use traps against the god again.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.030
However...

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:17.520
I activate Thor, Lord of the Aesir's effect!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:23.250
I negate and steal Armor Monster's effect, 
so my monster can't be destroyed in battle!

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.720
He stole Armor Master's effect.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.770
Crow's monster won't survive.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.970
Malus Token attacks Sirocco the Dawn!

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:48.560
Thor, Lord of the Aesir attacks Armor Master!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.890
Thunder Pyle!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.410
Crow!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:06.570
I was waiting for this moment!

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:11.720
When two Blackwings are 
destroyed in battle this turn,

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:16.550
I can Special Summon Blackwing - 
Brisote the Tailwind from my hand!

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.820
I flip over my trap card Black Return!

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:27.750
When I Special Summon a Blackwing monster,

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.790
one of the monsters on your 
field returns to your hand!

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:31.990
What?

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:34.670
Well done!  Since Thor is a Synchro Monster,

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.130
it returns to the Extra 
Deck instead of the hand.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:42.470
So in order to re-summon a god, he has to 
fulfill the summoning requirements from scratch.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:47.500
He stopped a second god from being 
summoned, and he sealed away Thor.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.450
Impressive, Crow!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.080
That's why he's 5D's trickster!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:53.640
When this effect returns 
your monster to your hand,

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:56.450
I regain life points equal 
to its attack points!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.560
Hurry up and return Thor to the Extra Deck!

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.770
Just kidding.

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.580
I flip over my trap card 
Nordic Relic Laevateinn!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:11.570
I destroy one monster that destroyed 
a monster in battle this turn!

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:12.570
What?

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:16.580
I'll destroy Thor, Lord of the Aesir 
before it's sent to the Extra Deck!

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:20.810
You're destroying your own god?

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:25.030
That means it'll return 
again at the End Phase!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:31.690
You were planning to make a 
comeback by sealing away my god

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.910
and regaining life points 
equal to its attack points.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.870
My trickster skills are greater than yours.

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.230
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:44.320
Then my god resurrects!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.460
You lose 800 life points!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:05.460
He destroyed his own god before 
it returned to the Extra Deck.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:11.870
Sheesh.  He destroyed my 
god not once, but twice.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.630
Only Brave would think of that strategy.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.170
He's playing around with a god.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.420
With only 650 life points, 
I'm past the safety line!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:31.690
If he has a Speed Spell in his 
hand, I'll lose on his next turn!

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:33.440
Crow, hang in there!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.180
Damn!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.730
It seems this is the best you can do.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:52.660
We can't entrust you with protecting 
the children and battling Iliaster!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:55.640
Protect the children?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.460
Who are you?

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:04.340
I used to be a lone wolf treasure hunter.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:10.620
I tracked and traveled around 
the world to get treasure.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:18.890
Suddenly, I met children.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:25.250
They were war orphans from 
neighboring countries.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:33.690
The children arrived on the island by 
themselves to escape the battlefields.

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:45.660
I could no longer leave the island.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:51.690
In a single night, this 
lone wolf had ten children.

00:14:52.770 --> 00:15:00.140
I heard a rumor that a certain society was 
behind the wars that killed the children's parents.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.060
They started the wars to make a profit.

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:05.700
That wasn't funny!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:09.130
The casualties of war 
are always the children!

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:15.230
They control wars around the world.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.900
Is the society you're talking about-

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.240
Iliaster!

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:22.950
I can't forgive them!

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.900
That's when I met Harald and Dragan.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:30.950
And I learned my mission.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:35.740
My mission is to defeat Iliaster!

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:41.380
No matter what happens to me, I'll 
protect the children from Iliaster!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:42.850
Brave...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.240
The right to challenge Iliaster 
is on the line in this battle!

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:49.760
I want to defeat Iliaster with my own hands!

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.230
Same here!

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:56.510
I also want to protect them!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.240
My turn!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:05.610
I summon the Tuner Monster Blackwing - 
Blizzard the Far North in defense position!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.350
Due to Blizzard the Far North's 
effect, I can Special Summon

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:13.880
a Level 4-or-below Blackwing monster 
from my graveyard in defense position!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.980
Come, Blackwing - Gale the Whirlwind!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.950
I flip over my trap card Blackboost!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:26.120
When there are two or more Blackwings on 
my field, I draw two cards from my deck!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.850
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Force!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:34.500
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters, 
you can't use your spells or traps

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:38.880
to destroy the cards on my field 
until the End Phase of my next turn!

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:45.150
Due to Gale the Whirlwind's effect, Thor, 
Lord of the Aesir's attack points are halved!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:53.320
Level 3 Gale the Whirlwind tunes 
Level 5 Brisote the Tailwind!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:58.090
Black whirlwind, your secret 
thoughts appear on your wings!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.880
Synchro Summon!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.830
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:13.500
Since Brisote the Tailwind was used to 
Synchro Summon, I regain 600 life points!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.140
Black-Winged Dragon attacks 
Thor, Lord of the Aesir!

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:19.120
Noble Stream!

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.760
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.620
Is that all your strength?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.520
You can't hurt me!

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.220
My god resurrects!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.810
You lose 800 life points!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.990
I still have all my strength!

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:46.940
What?

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:50.910
I activate Black-Winged Dragon's 
effect!  Damage Drain!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:55.850
What's that?

00:17:56.050 --> 00:18:00.810
Black-Winged Dragon takes the 
card effect damage instead of me!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:05.790
Every time that happens, Black-Winged 
Dragon loses 700 attack points!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.150
Well done, Crow!

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:11.500
As long as he has Black-Winged Dragon, he 
can stop Thor's effect when it resurrects!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:18.170
You're quite the trickster.  
That was a nice strategy.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:23.310
But it's no good because you're 
too focused on the god.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.850
What do you mean?

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.170
My turn!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.960
I summon Ljosalf of the Nordic Alfar.

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:39.270
Due to Ljosalf's effect, I can Special 
Summon a monster from my hand

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:43.710
whose Level equals Malus 
Token and Ljosalf's total!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:48.410
I Special Summon the Level 5 Tuner 
Monster Svartalf of the Nordic Alfar!

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.980
A Tuner Monster?  This is bad!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.600
Can it be the second god?

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:57.020
Level 5 Svartalf of the Nordic Alfar tunes

00:18:57.020 --> 00:19:03.090
Level 1 Malus Token and Level 
4 Ljosalf of the Nordic Alfar!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:09.770
The fickle god from the Polar World, show us 
your absolute power and laugh at the world!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.490
Synchro Summon!

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:16.230
Descend, Loki, Lord of the Aesir!

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:22.230
No way!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.110
It can't be!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:28.540
The second god finally appeared!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:41.250
I received a god, but I 
finally summoned my own god!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:43.630
Now I have two immortal gods!

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.220
Crow, it's over for you!

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:49.410
Loki, Lord of the Aesir 
attacks Black-Winged Dragon!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.540
I still have all my strength!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.510
I flip over my trap card Black Sonic!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:08.790
When Black-Winged Dragon is 
on my field and you attack,

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:13.740
all your monsters in attack 
position are removed from play!

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:14.930
What?

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:17.620
The gods can't resurrect if 
they're removed from play!

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.890
What an impressive strategy!  
You're incredible, Crow!

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:25.060
I haven't forgotten about the 
second god from the start!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.860
This is all my strength!

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.850
I sealed away two gods!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:35.540
Your full strength is impressive, 
but now that I summoned Loki,

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.940
Lord of the Aesir, nothing 
can touch the gods.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:38.910
What?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.750
I activate Loki, Lord of the Aesir's effect!

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:48.330
When Loki attacks, one card in your Spell 
and Trap Card Zone is negated and destroyed!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.730
No way...

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.860
I'll bury your Black-Winged Dragon!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.350
Vanity Bullet!

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.450
My other god can still attack!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.530
Thor, Lord of the Aesir attacks 
Blizzard the Far North!

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.280
Thunder Pyle!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.650
Whoa!  Crow's trap misfired!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:30.660
Furthermore, two gods are 
conquering the field!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.120
Oh no!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.130
After he made it this far...

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:34.440
Crow!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.180
Crow has only 50 life points left!

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:40.540
He has no cards in his hand 
and no monsters on his field!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:43.670
How will Crow escape this pinch?

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:56.690
Close to you  Keep what's 
